Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Punchcards Chew the Ring
- Story & Context: During the first unauthorized gathering inside Magnet Bay Three, Hélène Vane rammed her custom bocal into a red-lined tube preamp just as an improvised generator blew sparks across the damp concrete. The stench of scorched cork grease and ionized rust filled the air when the bassoon’s amplified low-B shook loose steel rivets from the overhead gantry. Refusing to cut the circuit, the sound crew routed the shrieking sub-harmonic down the accelerator’s curved beam pipe, locking two hundred sweat-drenched punks into an unrelenting three-hour march. Hélène spat into the track ballast, snarled "The orbit is hungry tonight," and held the single droning key until her lower lip cracked open.
